cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this inventory, its data products or its calculation engine, please cite it as below."
title: "PakEmis 1.0.0rc68: greenhouse gas and air pollutant emissions in Pakistan, July 2015–June 2025"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible national emissions inventory for Pakistan covering ten sectors, with
  national, provincial, district and gridded products. Sector modules satisfy a common
  software contract; cross-sector fuel and material transfers close by construction;
  structural choices are reported as named scenarios rather than folded into parametric
  uncertainty; and every figure and table in the accompanying manuscripts is generated
  from the calculation engine. Excludes LULUCF, which is carried as an exploratory module
  outside all totals.
type: software
version: 1.0.0rc68
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/PakAirQuality/pakistan-emissions-sectors/blob/main/LICENSE"
repository-code: "https://github.com/PakAirQuality/pakistan-emissions-sectors"
url: "https://emissions.hawanama.org"
authors:
  - family-names: Ahmad
    given-names: Rehan
    email: rehan@pakairquality.com
    affiliation: "Pakistan Air Quality Initiative (PAQI), Karachi, Pakistan"
keywords:
  - greenhouse gas inventory
  - air pollutant inventory
  - IPCC 2006 Guidelines
  - Pakistan
  - reproducible research
  - emissions accounting
# The data products carry CC-BY-4.0 (LICENSE-data); the code carries MIT (LICENSE).
#
# DOIs are minted at archival, and are deliberately ABSENT rather than present-and-empty:
# the CFF schema requires a doi identifier's value to match ^10\..+, so a placeholder
# would make this file invalid and GitHub would show it as broken. When the Zenodo
# release exists, add:
#
#   identifiers:
#     - type: doi
#       value: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX    # concept DOI, all versions
#       description: "Zenodo concept DOI (resolves to the latest version)"
#     - type: doi
#       value: 10.5281/zenodo.YYYYYYY    # this version
#       description: "Zenodo DOI for v1.0.0-rc68"
#
# and set the same values in .zenodo.json and pkinv.report.release_manifest.DOI.
